{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/fa3f0000d4ebd6b57f54147c2fb2f883.avif?t=1772006065\" width=780 height=342 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A valiant knight and a mysterious magic cat\u2014what sparks will fly on the road ahead?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/28490a3df27020626cb5f3a491a9043c.poster.avif?t=1772006065\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/28490a3df27020626cb5f3a491a9043c.webm?t=1772006065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/28490a3df27020626cb5f3a491a9043c.mp4?t=1772006065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blade of Wiz</strong> is a top-down action roguelike. Play as <strong>Sera</strong>, a wandering knight exiled after being possessed by a spirit. Alongside the culprit\u2014a mysterious black cat spirit\u2014delve into the heart of the imperial capital to find a way to break the \u201cspiritbound curse.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/b41edd6764d0ee09d312058ae335f03b.avif?t=1772006065\" width=780 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey is packed with dangers, but this seemingly hostile cat might just be your greatest help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the black cat spirit\u2019s skills to match your attack style. Build the right combo, and it becomes your edge in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/6d7c1b72097f5bfd67281016931849b4.poster.avif?t=1772006065\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/6d7c1b72097f5bfd67281016931849b4.webm?t=1772006065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/6d7c1b72097f5bfd67281016931849b4.mp4?t=1772006065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/203ab5064ded28ffc880b29aeea2437f.avif?t=1772006065\" width=780 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brute force isn\u2019t enough. <strong>Blade of Wiz</strong> features a full elemental system. Mix wind, fire, lightning, ice, and more to supercharge your moves. Combine them with 40+ crests to craft the playstyle you want\u2014let imagination run wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/f79f694c82b8afba3b4ee40345268080.poster.avif?t=1772006065\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/f79f694c82b8afba3b4ee40345268080.webm?t=1772006065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/f79f694c82b8afba3b4ee40345268080.mp4?t=1772006065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/c53699c616a37a7b4af9af6cc2ffeb94.avif?t=1772006065\" width=780 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your route. Each icon signals the challenge ahead\u2014earn more cat skills, unlock new attacks, or take a breather to recover HP. Keep pushing, keep getting stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/5dd644228bf55957184ec0dd0585d58e.poster.avif?t=1772006065\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/5dd644228bf55957184ec0dd0585d58e.webm?t=1772006065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/5dd644228bf55957184ec0dd0585d58e.mp4?t=1772006065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125540/extras/8efdd688afea9ebab5c771f8f1a85c4f.avif?t=1772006065\" width=780 height=94 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 major chapters, 10+ stages per chapter\u2014every door hides the unknown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple side quests uncovering the ancient castle\u2019s story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of weapons across ranged, melee, and magic combat styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wind/Fire/Lightning/Ice and more\u2014flashy, varied combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ crests to discover and build around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lend the cat a paw\u2014and let it lend you one back.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3125540?t=1772006065","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap